# REQ-314-T9 Audit Analysis Report

## Executive Summary

| Category | Findings | Severity |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Logical Contradictions | 2 | **HIGH** |
| Missing Edge Cases | 6 | MEDIUM-HIGH |
| Context Gaps | 4 | MEDIUM |
